:: Park Lichen

<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<set $bus to "park">>
You approach the statue in the middle of the park. It's covered in white lichen.

<<if C.npc.Avery.init is 1>>
	<<wearProp "lichen" "white">>
	You wait for a gap in the foot traffic, then peel a sample from a low patch of stone. It comes away in stubborn flakes and leaves grit beneath your nails.
	<br><br>
	<<set $sciencelichenpark to 1>>
	<<link [[Step away|Park]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You could collect some for your science project, but the plinth is taller than you. The lower stone has been scraped clean by weather and careless hands, leaving the better growth above your head.
	<br><br>
	<<laddericon>><<link [[Climb up (0:30)|Park Lichen Climb]]>><<pass 30>><<set $sciencelichenpark to 1>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 1 1000>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask someone for help (0:30)|Park Lichen Help]]>><<set $sciencelichenpark to 1>><<pass 30>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Park]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Park Lichen Climb

<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<set $bus to "park">>
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	<<wearProp "lichen" "white">>
	You <span class="green">successfully</span> climb onto the plinth. The lichen is attached firm, but you manage to pry it free with some effort. A few heads turn but no one bothers you until you hear a voice shout from across the park. "Oi!" It's a <<npc Avery>><<set $averySeen.pushUnique("meetPark")>><<set $averySeen.pushUnique("meekParkPolice")>><<generatePolice 2>><<person2>><<person>> dressed as a police officer. "Get down from there or I'll have your hide."
	<<gstress>><<stress 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Explain yourself|Park Lichen Explain]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Run|Park Lichen Run]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You reach up and try to lift your body, but your arms give way and you tumble to the ground.
	<<gstress>><<gpain>><<stress 3>><<pain 6>>
	<br><br>
	<<npc Avery>><<initnpc Avery>><<set $averySeen.pushUnique("meetPark")>><<person1>>You hear a <<nnpc_gender "Avery">>'s laughter before you can get your bearings. A pair of arms catches you by the shoulders and steadies you. Not stopping there, <<he>> holds you by the hips and lifts with surprising strength, high enough for you to scramble onto the plinth.
	<<if setup.clothes.lower[clothesIndex('lower', $worn.lower)].skirt is 1>>
		You feel your face flush as you realise <<he>> could have seen up your $worn.lower.name. If <<he>> did <<he>> gives no sign.
	<</if>>
	<<He>> steps back, still smiling. "Why'd you want to go up there anyway?"
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Honest|Park Lichen Honest]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Evasive|Park Lichen Evasive]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Park Lichen Help

<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<set $bus to "park">>
You look around for someone who might help. You see a <<npc Avery>><<initnpc Avery>><<set $averySeen.pushUnique("meetPark")>><<person1>><<nnpc_gender "Avery">> already watching you. <<He>> laughs and approaches. <<He>> says nothing, but grabs you by the hips and helps lift you with surprising strength. It's enough for you to clamber up.
<<if setup.clothes.lower[clothesIndex('lower', $worn.lower)].skirt is 1>>
	You feel your face flush as you realise <<he>> could have seen up your $worn.lower.name. If <<he>> did <<he>> gives no sign.
<</if>>
<<He>> dusts <<his>> hands and smiles up at you. "Why'd you want to go up there anyway?"
<br><br>
<<link [[Honest|Park Lichen Honest]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Evasive|Park Lichen Evasive]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Park Lichen Run

<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<set $bus to "park">>
<<person2>>You turn away from the <<person>> and jump from the plinth. Right into the arms of a waiting <<person1>><<nnpc_gender "Avery">>. The <<person2>><<person2>><<person>> runs around the plinth, but stops when <<he>> sees the newcomer. "This your <<girl>> then?" <<he>> says. "<<pShe stranger>> <<pverb "was" "were" stranger>> defacing public property."
<br><br>
"<<pShe "Avery">> <<pverb "has" "have" "Avery">> done no such thing," the <<person1>><<nnpc_gender "Avery">> says, keeping you close while <<he>> glares at the <<person2>><<person>>. "And you know it."
<br><br>
The <<person>> seems less confident. <<He>> gives the statue one last look, sheathes <<his>> baton, and turns away.
<br><br>
<<person1>>The newcomer releases you from <<his>> arms only when the <<person2>><<person>> has gone. "I hope you're okay," <<he>> says, giving you a practised smile. "I'm Avery. I bet you're thirsty after that. Would you like to get a drink? I know this cute little place."
<br><br>
<<link [[Accept|Park Lichen Accept]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Refuse|Park Lichen Refuse]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Park Lichen Explain

<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<set $bus to "park">>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I-It's for my science project," you say.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"It's for my science project," you say. "I only needed a small sample. I wasn't trying to damage anything."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I-It's for my science project," you say. You keep your hands where <<he>> can see them.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"I need it to win the science fair," you say.
<<else>>
	"I need lichen for my science project," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>
"Is that right?" <<he>> says. "Looks like you're defacing a statue to me." <<He>> raises <<his>> baton and rubs <<his>> palm with it, making sure you notice.
<br><br>
<<person1>>"The <<girl>>'s doing no such thing," a <<nnpc_gender "Avery">>'s voice says from behind you. <<He>> walks around the statue and glares at the <<person2>><<person>>. "And you know it."
<br><br>
The <<person>> seems less confident. "This your <<girl>> then? Tell <<phim stranger>> to get down from there." <<He>> sheathes <<his>> baton and turns away.
<br><br>
<<person1>>The newcomer offers an arm and helps you climb down. "Did I hear you right?" <<he>> asks. "A scientist in the making?" <<He>> smiles. "I'm Avery. I bet you're thirsty after that. Would you like to get a drink? I know this cute little place."
<br><br>
<<link [[Accept|Park Lichen Accept]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Refuse|Park Lichen Refuse]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Park Lichen Honest

<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<set $bus to "park">>
<<wearProp "lichen" "white">>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I-it's for my science project," you say.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"It's for my science project," you say. "Thank you for helping."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I-it's for my science project," you say. You keep your voice low, as if the statue itself might object.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"I need it to win the science fair," you say.
<<else>>
	"I need lichen for my science project," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>
"A scientist in the making?" <<he>> says. "I'll help you down when you're done. I'm only out for a stroll, there's no rush."
<br><br>
The lichen is attached firm, but you manage to pry it free with some effort. <<He>> offers an arm and helps you climb down. "I'm Avery," <<he>> says. "I bet you're thirsty after that. Would you like to get a drink? I know this cute little place."
<br><br>
<<link [[Accept|Park Lichen Accept]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Refuse|Park Lichen Refuse]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Park Lichen Evasive

<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<set $bus to "park">>
<<wearProp "lichen" "white">>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I-It's nothing," you say.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Just school work," you say. "Sorry, it's not very interesting."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I-It's nothing," you say. You pick at the lichen rather than look at <<him>>.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"None of your business," you say.
<<else>>
	"School stuff," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> nods, still watching you. "I'll help you down when you're done. I'm only out for a stroll, there's no rush."
<br><br>
The lichen is attached firm, but you manage to pry it free with some effort. <<He>> offers an arm and helps you climb down. "I'm Avery," <<he>> says. "I bet you're thirsty after that. Would you like to get a drink? I know this cute little place."
<br><br>
<<link [[Accept|Park Lichen Accept]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Refuse|Park Lichen Refuse]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Park Lichen Accept

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<wearProp "juice">>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"T-Thank you," you say, following close enough not to lose <<him>> in the foot traffic.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"That's kind of you," you say. "Thank you."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"If you're sure," you say, letting <<him>> choose the way.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Fine," you say. "One drink."
<<else>>
	"Sure," you say. "A drink sounds good."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> leads you to a small cafe at the edge of the park. <<He>> orders a coffee for <<him>> and some fruit juice for you before you can look at the menu for long. The <<generateRole 2 0 "waiter/waitress">><<person3>><<personsimple>><<person1>> thinks you're Avery's <<pdaughter>>. <<He>> is old enough to be your <<if $pronoun is "m">>father<<else>>mother<</if>>, but <<hes>> in good shape. <<He>> smiles at you across the table as if the mistake amuses <<him>>.
<br><br>
You talk with Avery over the drinks. <<He>> asks a lot of questions about school, town, and your project, but is reluctant to answer yours. Whenever you look up from your juice, <<his>> eyes are already on you.
<br><br>
<<Hes>> asking if you're happy at school when <<hes>> interrupted by a buzzing in <<his>> pocket. "I'm sorry. It's work. I need to go." 
<br><br>
<<He>> stands, smooths <<his>> clothes, then hesitates before leaning close.
<br><br>
<<set $averySeen.pushUnique("meetCafe")>>

<<link [[Smooch|Park Lichen Smooch]]>><<npcincr Avery love 1>><</link>><<glove>><<promiscuous1>><<kissvirginitywarning>>
<br>
<<link [[Stay still|Park Lichen Still]]>><<npcincr Avery love 1>><</link>><<glove>>
<br>
<<link [[Move away|Park Lichen Move]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Park Lichen Refuse

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"N-No thank you," you say.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Thank you, but I should get back," you say.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I should go," you say, keeping your eyes low.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"No," you say. "I've got better things to do."
<<else>>
	"No, thanks. I should get on with my project," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> frowns for a moment, but covers it with a smile. "Of course," <<he>> says. "I'm sure you're busy. I'll see you around."
<br><br>

<<if $scienceproject is "ongoing">>
	<span class="gold">You can add the lichen you found to your project in your room or the school library.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Park]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<endevent>>
	<<destinationeventend>>
<</if>>

:: Park Lichen Smooch

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>>
You lean in and plant a kiss on <<his>> lips. <<He>> kisses back. <<takeKissVirginity "Avery" `($auriga_artefact?"loveInterest":"romantic")`>>
<<if _pcKissVirginityTaken>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<promiscuity1>>
<<He>> pulls away and glances around the cafe as if concerned about who's watching. "I'll be in touch," <<he>> says, smiling.
<br><br>
You leave soon after <<him>>, but <<hes>> already gone.
<br><br>
<<if $scienceproject is "ongoing">>
	<span class="gold">You can add the lichen you found to your project in your room or the school library.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Park]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<endevent>>
	<<destinationeventend>>
<</if>>

